#### CSS & GPU Acceleration Rules:
```css
/* GPU layer promotion & performance bounds */
main, .strip, .shelf-rail { 
  will-change: transform; 
}

.card, .card-poster { 
  contain: layout style; 
  display: inline-block;
  vertical-align: top;
  position: relative;
  width: 220px; /* Poster width */
  margin-right: 24px;
}

.card .pic, .poster-media {
  position: relative;
  width: 220px;
  height: 330px; /* 2:3 TMDB ratio */
  border-radius: 14px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #26292f;
  transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
}

.card img, .poster-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
}

/* Rating Chip */
.card .chip, .poster-rating-badge {
  position: absolute;
  top: 10px;
  right: 10px;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,.65);
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #fdd663;
}

/* Captions and Titles */
.card .ttl, .poster-title {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 12px;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: #e8eaed;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.card .cap, .poster-meta {
  margin-top: 4px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #bdc1c6;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  opacity: 0.85;
  transition: opacity .2s;
}

/* Spatial Remote Focus Elevation */
.card.focused .pic,
.card-poster.focused .poster-media,
.focus .pic {
  transform: scale(1.08);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px #fff, 0 14px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.75);
}

.card.focused .ttl,
.card-poster.focused .poster-title {
  color: #FFFFFF;
}

.card.focused .cap,
.card-poster.focused .poster-meta {
  opacity: 1;
  color: #FFFFFF;
}
```

